    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... the \"surrender\" part sounds so much better than this struggle. but i'm scared that if i stop fighting, i'll just be lost. i feel like the only way to actually stop the weight for good is to just... not have to deal with it anymore. is that wrong to think? like, is it actually okay to just want it all to be over?",
